<p class="auth-switch">Belum memiliki akun Tim Rekrutmen? <a href="/register">Daftar di sini</a></p><p style="font-size:12px;margin:12px 0 0">Demo Super Admin: <strong>admin / admin123</strong><br>Demo Tim Rekrutmen: <strong>sib</strong>, <strong>sti</strong>, <strong>sbp</strong>, atau <strong>appslings</strong> / <strong>rekrutmen123</strong></p></div></body></html>
